   {
      "type":"context",
      "index":1,
      "text":[
         "Named Ashen because of his old age complemented by grey hairs and grey",
         "clothing, he is never seen with a quest marker or icon to make him stand",
         "out; not even a slight glow or striking piece of clothing. He simply",
         "stands out by being alone in a busy corner or intersection."
      ]
   },
   {
      "type":"context",
      "index":2,
      "text":[
         "Ashen usually leans on a wall, tree, or post resting or thinking. If not,",
         "he may be seen standing while calmly observing his surroundings,",
         "passers-by, or an event near him. When players and other NPCs move",
         "close enough, he may say something to them."
      ]
   },
   {
      "type":"dialogue",
      "index":3,
      "speakers":[
         "Ashen",
         "NPC"
      ],
      "lines":[
         {
            "speaker":"Ashen",
            "text":[
               "“Careful,” he mildly said to one passer-by while pointing to a spot.",
               "“The steps used to dip right there.”"
            ]
         },
         {
            "speaker":"NPC",
            "text":[
               "The player paused, confused. There were no steps. Just flat ground."
            ]
         },
         {
            "speaker":"NPC",
            "text":[
               "“Right,” they said after a couple of seconds, and moved around the",
               "spot anyway."
            ]
         }
      ],
      "raw_lines":[
         "“Careful,” he mildly said to one passer-by while pointing to a spot.",
         "“The steps used to dip right there.”",
         "",
         "The player paused, confused. There were no steps. Just flat ground.",
         "",
         "“Right,” they said after a couple of seconds, and moved around the spot",
         "anyway.",
         "",
         "Ashen nodded, satisfied."
      ]
   },
   {
      "type":"context",
      "index":4,
      "text":[
         "He had lived through many eras and watched the world around him change.",
         "He did not mention any of this, but spoke as if the developments were",
         "recent."
      ]
   },
   {
      "type":"dialogue",
      "index":5,
      "speakers":[
         "Ashen",
         "Baker"
      ],
      "lines":[
         {
            "speaker":"Ashen",
            "text":[
               "“You’re late,” he told the baker on a particular evening. “But the",
               "wind’s kinder now. You won’t lose as much flour.”"
            ]
         },
         {
            "speaker":"Baker",
            "text":[
               "The baker blinked, ran their idle animation, and smiled.",
               "“Yes,” they said. “The wind is kinder.”"
            ]
         }
      ],
      "raw_lines":[
         "“You’re late,” he told the baker on a particular evening. “But the wind’s",
         "kinder now. You won’t lose as much flour.\"",
         "",
         "The baker blinked, ran their idle animation, and smiled.",
         "",
         "“Yes,” they said. “The wind is kinder.”"
      ]
   },
   {
      "type":"context",
      "index":6,
      "text":[
         "Players noticed him eventually, They always did.",
         "He remembered their old looks, wears, or accessories; things like",
         "hairstyles, armor sets, and gems. He also commented on players’",
         "nature or even asked about old companions."
      ]
   },
   {
      "type":"dialogue",
      "index":7,
      "speakers":[
         "Ashen",
         "Player"
      ],
      "lines":[
         {
            "speaker":"Ashen",
            "text":[
               "“Is the hound still with you?” he asked a player once, glancing at an",
               "empty space near their boots."
            ]
         },
         {
            "speaker":"Player",
            "text":[
               "The player shook their head.",
               "“No. That was . . . a while ago.”"
            ]
         },
         {
            "speaker":"Ashen",
            "text":[
               "Ashen considered this. “Ah. He liked the riverbank,” he said.",
               "“Always waited there.”"
            ]
         },
         {
            "speaker":"Player",
            "text":[
               "The player looked at the direction of the river for a moment before",
               "walking away."
            ]
         }
      ],
      "raw_lines":[
